@startuml uc_kesiapsiagaan_iot
left to right direction
title SIGAP — Use Case: Kesiapsiagaan & IoT (Unit Utama + Sirine)

actor "Warga Desa" as Warga
actor "Admin / Operator" as AdminOp
actor "Unit Utama" as UU
actor "Sirine/Toa" as Si

rectangle "Sistem SIGAP" {
  usecase "Lihat Info Kesiapsiagaan" as UC3
  usecase "Terima Notifikasi Level Alert" as UC4
  usecase "Evaluasi Rule Threshold" as UC_rule
  usecase "Sediakan Level untuk Polling" as UC11
  usecase "Verifikasi Level & Putuskan Tindakan" as UC8
  usecase "Trigger Sirine" as UC9
  usecase "Notifikasi Operator" as UC_notif
}

Warga --> UC3
Warga --> UC4

UC_rule .> UC11 : <<include>>
UU --> UC11 : polling setiap 15 detik\n(REST Polling, ADR-013 - FINAL)

UU --> UC8 : Unit Utama menampilkan level
UC8 .> UC_notif : <<include>>
AdminOp --> UC8

UC9 .> UC8 : <<extend>>
note right of UC9
  Extension point: hanya aktif jika
  level = ORANGE atau RED (bukan
  Kuning/Merah 3-tier - sudah final
  4-tier, ADR-030). Level GREEN/YELLOW
  tidak membuka opsi ini (safeguard
  by design, ADR-011).
  Cooldown 60 detik pasca-trigger,
  dipotong otomatis saat eskalasi RED.
  Broadcast ke SELURUH Sirine terdaftar,
  tidak ada pemilihan perangkat (FS-09).
end note
AdminOp --> UC9
UC9 --> Si : bunyikan sirine (broadcast)
Si --> UU : laporkan ack via siklus\npoll berikutnya

note right of UC_notif
  Web Push langsung ke warga SUDAH
  LIVE (VAPID). Integrasi SID sebagai
  kanal tambahan (dual-channel) masih
  menunggu sign-off Tim SID - lihat
  Roadmap Tahap 2 §2.1 #5.
end note

@enduml